SEARCH_SOURCES: Semantic Scholar (per-year sweeps of the Query Bank with no citation floor, 181 queries for 2026 plus gap queries; title and DOI batch lookups), CrossRef REST (journal article lists by ISSN for the core venues, queried by publication date and by print date; book, monograph, edited-book and book-part lists by Kant query terms; DOI-level metadata; review search by title), PhilPapers and the open web via Brave/WebSearch (publisher and review pages), WebFetch (Princeton University Press page for Hunter 2026), NDPR (sitemap check; the sitemap held no 2026 reviews, one 2025 review is recorded under Bruno), SEP (get_sep_context.py for the four High entries across 17 Kant entries: 68 calls, all with no hits, as expected for 2025-2026 works), abstract resolution via S2, OpenAlex-backed records returned by the enrichment script, CORE and CrossRef. search_openalex.py was not used. IEP was not searched in the 6a and 6b runs.
