NOTABLE_GAPS:
Empty or thin cells. Opus postumum: one 2025 entry (Thomson) and none in 2026 (S2 returned no 2026 results for the Opus postumum, transition and ether queries; the only 2026 item found is Zhang's review of Thomson, Graduate Faculty Philosophy Journal). Pre-critical: Kain 2025 (secondary tag) and Schnieder 2026; no 2025 primary entry. Religion: none in 2025; one in 2026 (Hunter). Animals, disability and education: none in either year (2026 items found were low-visibility articles or non-Anglophone journal pieces, for example Kinoshita on Kant's theory of education, and a book review of Interpreting Kant for Education, London Review of Education). Gender: one 2025 entry (Sabourin); the 2026 gender article (Sanchez Madrid, Canadian Journal of Philosophy, online 2026-09-17) was not included. Teleology and biology: none in 2026 (Teufel 2025 only). Mind and cognition: none in 2025. Reception: one 2025 entry (Bruno) and, in 2026, only secondary reception tags (Khurana, Longuenesse, Schlicht); Kant and Cassirer (eds. Pollok and Filieri, Meiner) and Kant and the Space of Feelings (eds. Fabbianelli and Falduto, De Gruyter) carry 2026 online dates only and no print date, and were left out. Editions, translations and reference works: one 2025 entry (the Volckmann Logic edition); none in 2026 (S2 returned no 2026 results for the Cambridge Edition, Kant-Kongress and Companion queries; the Naturrecht Feyerabend edition reviewed in Kant-Studien 117(1) is dated 2024 by CrossRef). No NDPR reviews dated 2026 exist in the NDPR sitemap, and the search_ndpr.py fuzzy search returned no usable output in this run, so NDPR coverage for 2026 books is unknown. Year-boundary effect: CrossRef print dates after 2026-09-30 (for example Laub, Kant als Geograph, print 2026-12-08, Mentis) were treated as announced, not yet published, and excluded.
Shortfall against the targets: 2025 has 15 entries (target 10-15); 2026 has 13 (brief target about 5-10; the surplus reflects a large number of 2026 CUP and journal items with verifiable print dates). No Domain 6 seed was unverified (there were no seeds).
