Source issues: S2 rate-limited some queries (re-run until each query returned success or a genuine not_found; five 2026 queries, on the Inaugural Dissertation, the Opus postumum transition, the Cambridge Edition, Kant-Kongress proceedings and Companion to Kant, returned no results); CrossRef returned non-JSON for five journal-year lists in the first pass (Critical Inquiry, Dialogue, Metaphilosophy, Journal of Aesthetic Education, Journal of Ethics) and was re-run successfully; search_ndpr.py returned no usable output. S2 holds no record for two 2026 books (Longuenesse; Brecher and Hirsch), so their S2 counts are recorded as absent.

